<title>UK: London tea sale average price.</title>
<headline>London tea sale average price.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average for the 3,487 packages of landed tea sold at this weeks London sale was 123.91 pence a kilo against 127.11 last week and 108.57 a year ago.</p>
<p>The average for the 100,870 pkgs sold so far this year is 129.35 pence against 113.43 pence for the 134,748 pkgs sold by this stage last year.</p>
</text>
